{"id":"7cd6386b14d5d667","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-slice-category.md","title":"Definition — 切片范畴及其态射","display":"Definition — 切片范畴及其态射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-slice-category","aliases":["14-df-slice-category"],"display":"Definition — 切片范畴及其态射","source_ref":"Categorical Preliminaries; I.9, pp.57–61; IV.7, pp.190–191","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-morphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-slice-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-slice-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 切片范畴及其态射"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Categorical Preliminaries; I.9, pp.57–61; IV.7, pp.190–191"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>。切片对象记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(A,p)\">\\(P=(A,p)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:A\\to B\">\\(p:A\\to B\\)</span>；切片态射严格编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P,Q,u)\">\\((P,Q,u)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 是环境范畴箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_B,M_B,\\mathrm{dom}_B,\\mathrm{cod}_B,\\mathrm{id}_{/B},\\circ_B,b_B\">\\(O_B,M_B,\\mathrm{dom}_B,\\mathrm{cod}_B,\\mathrm{id}_{/B},\\circ_B,b_B\\)</span> 为下式定义的数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_B\">\\(b_B\\)</span> 提取底层箭头。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_B=\\{(A,p)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land p\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_B=\\{(A,p)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land p\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_B=\\{((A,p),(A&#39;,p&#39;),u)\\mid(A,p),(A&#39;,p&#39;)\\in O_B\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,A&#39;)\\land p&#39;\\circ u=p\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_B=\\{((A,p),(A&#39;,p&#39;),u)\\mid(A,p),(A&#39;,p&#39;)\\in O_B\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,A&#39;)\\land p&#39;\\circ u=p\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dom}_B(P,Q,u)=P,\\qquad\\mathrm{cod}_B(P,Q,u)=Q,\\qquad b_B(P,Q,u)=u\\quad((P,Q,u)\\in M_B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{dom}_B(P,Q,u)=P,\\qquad\\mathrm{cod}_B(P,Q,u)=Q,\\qquad b_B(P,Q,u)=u\\quad((P,Q,u)\\in M_B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_{/B}(A,p)=((A,p),(A,p),\\operatorname{id}_A),\\qquad(Q,R,v)\\circ_B(P,Q,u)=(P,R,v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{id}_{/B}(A,p)=((A,p),(A,p),\\operatorname{id}_A),\\qquad(Q,R,v)\\circ_B(P,Q,u)=(P,R,v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C/B=(O_B,M_B,\\mathrm{dom}_B,\\mathrm{cod}_B,\\mathrm{id}_{/B},\\circ_B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C/B=(O_B,M_B,\\mathrm{dom}_B,\\mathrm{cod}_B,\\mathrm{id}_{/B},\\circ_B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C/B}(P,Q)=\\{m\\in M_B:\\mathrm{dom}_B(m)=P\\land\\mathrm{cod}_B(m)=Q\\},\\qquad1_{\\mathcal C/B}=(B,\\operatorname{id}_B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C/B}(P,Q)=\\{m\\in M_B:\\mathrm{dom}_B(m)=P\\land\\mathrm{cod}_B(m)=Q\\},\\qquad1_{\\mathcal C/B}=(B,\\operatorname{id}_B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>交换三角形在复合下稳定，所以给出完整范畴。源、靶由标签给出，恒等与结合律继承自环境范畴。到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,1_B)\">\\((B,1_B)\\)</span> 的唯一切片箭头是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A,p),(B,1_B),p)\">\\(((A,p),(B,1_B),p)\\)</span>，因此它是切片终对象。使用裸环境箭头不会区分它在不同基底结构之间的切片源、靶，本次补全三元组编码。切片的积是环境范畴中对共同基底 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的拉回；这解释了原书把子对象量词视为“换基”的原因。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，Categorical Preliminaries; I.9, pp.57–61; IV.7, pp.190–191。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"P=(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"p:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"(P,Q,u)","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"O_B,M_B,\\mathrm{dom}_B,\\mathrm{cod}_B,\\mathrm{id}_{/B},\\circ_B,b_B","display":false},{"tex":"b_B","display":false},{"tex":"O_B=\\{(A,p)\\mid A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land p\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"M_B=\\{((A,p),(A',p'),u)\\mid(A,p),(A',p')\\in O_B\\land u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,A')\\land p'\\circ u=p\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dom}_B(P,Q,u)=P,\\qquad\\mathrm{cod}_B(P,Q,u)=Q,\\qquad b_B(P,Q,u)=u\\quad((P,Q,u)\\in M_B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}_{/B}(A,p)=((A,p),(A,p),\\operatorname{id}_A),\\qquad(Q,R,v)\\circ_B(P,Q,u)=(P,R,v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}u).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C/B=(O_B,M_B,\\mathrm{dom}_B,\\mathrm{cod}_B,\\mathrm{id}_{/B},\\circ_B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C/B}(P,Q)=\\{m\\in M_B:\\mathrm{dom}_B(m)=P\\land\\mathrm{cod}_B(m)=Q\\},\\qquad1_{\\mathcal C/B}=(B,\\operatorname{id}_B).","display":true},{"tex":"(B,1_B)","display":false},{"tex":"((A,p),(B,1_B),p)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":2300,"backlinks":[{"id":"269866ac001274e3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是有拉回的范畴，$f:A\\to B$。切片对象和箭头采用[[14-df-slice-category]]的标签编码；$b_A,b_B$ 提取底层箭头。对每个 $P=(X,p:X\\to B)$，固定拉回 $(X_f,a_P,x_P)$，其中 $a_P:X_f\\to A$、$x_P:X_f\\to X$，满足 $fa_P=px_P$。对 $P'=(X',p')$ 同样固定拉回。$u=(P,P',h)$ 是 $\\mathcal E/B$ 箭头；$Q=(Y,q:Y\\to A)$、$Q'=(Y',q')$，$v=(Q,Q',k)$ 是 $\\mathcal E/A$ 箭头。$\\langle-,-\\rangle_{f,p}$ 是 [[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]] 的 $\\operatorname{PBPair}$ 在所选数据 $(X_f,a_P,x_P)$ 上的缩写；各次使用的源对象由输入箭头的共同源确定。"},{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-slice-category|df-216 — 切片范畴及其态射]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-slice-category]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-slice-category]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-slice-category]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-slice-category]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-slice-category|df-216 — 切片范畴及其态射]]"},{"id":"ad0895bc76f1713f","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x_Z$、$y_Z$ 分别是 $f'^*h^*Z$、$g^*f^*Z$ 的底层对象沿两次拉回到 $Z$ 底层对象的投影复合；$b_{A'}$ 见[[14-df-slice-category]]。自然变换三元组采用[[14-df-natural-transformation]]；$(\\alpha_P)_P$、$(\\beta_P)_P$ 遍历 $P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E/A)$。"},{"id":"eeaa128b028a8273","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[14-df-open-closed-topologies]] 的数据；$\\mathcal S=\\mathbf{Sh}_{j_U^{\\mathrm o}}(\\mathcal E)$。切片对象为 $P=(Y,p:Y\\to U)$，切片箭头为 [[14-df-slice-category]] 的 $(P,Q,h)$，其中 $h$ 是底层箭头。$\\Lambda_U$ 为指数转置，$\\operatorname{ev}_{Y,U}:Y^U\\times U\\to Y$ 为求值；下式定义 $h^U$，其中 $h:Y\\to Z$。$F,G$ 是以下分量给出的候选函子；$h:X\\to X'$ 在第一式中为 $\\mathcal S$ 的箭头。"},{"id":"abee8603b9a8b54a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 是初等拓扑斯，固定分类子 $(\\Omega,t)$、有限极限与指数；$B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。切片与底层箭头投影 $b_B$ 见[[14-df-slice-category]]，切片分类子见[[14-thm-slice-subobject-classifier]]。$P=(C,p:C\\to B)$、$Q=(Z,q:Z\\to B)$ 是切片对象。$P_C=\\Omega^C$，$\\operatorname{ev}_C:P_C\\times C\\to\\Omega$；$\\lambda_C$ 是以 $C$ 为指数参数的转置。$\\delta_B$ 是下式定义的对角分类箭头，$\\chi_m$ 采用 [[14-df-subobject-classifier]]。下式中的各 $\\pi$ 均为相应已选积投影；$\\Theta_{P,Q}$ 中的 $(-)^{-1}$ 为 [[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]] 的子对象逆像函数。"},{"id":"d3c2290aa1563742","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 有有限极限，$(\\Omega,\\operatorname{true}:1\\to\\Omega)$ 为子对象分类子，$B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)$。$\\pi_B:\\Omega\\times B\\to B$ 为投影，$m:(S,q)\\hookrightarrow(A,p)$ 为切片单态射；$m_0=b_B(m):S\\to A$ 为 [[14-df-slice-category]] 的底层箭头提取，$\\chi_{m_0}:A\\to\\Omega$ 为其环境分类映射。$t_B$、$\\chi^B_m$ 为以下定义的带切片源、靶的箭头。"}],"outgoing":["28211adc1b0ce5bc","5c5452002ba29fda"]}